{"strings": [
{"key": "data.lesson.first_market.say.1", "text": "Compra poco y bien. Un estante enorme en un bar nuevo es dinero parado.", "src": "Buy narrow. A wide shelf on a new bar is just money standing still."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.0", "text": "Seis botellas y un barril. Técnicamente, eso es un bar.", "src": "Six bottles and a keg. That is a bar, technically."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.1", "text": "Léelos antes de servir — la credencial dice a qué vinieron.", "src": "Read them before you pour — the licence says what they came for."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.0", "text": "La caja no alcanza para el alquiler. A todo salón le pasa una vez.", "src": "The till is under the rent. It happens to every room once."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.1", "text": "Dos veces es costumbre. Tres, y es otro bar con tu nombre en la puerta.", "src": "Twice is a habit. Three times is a different bar with your name on it."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.0", "text": "Dos destilados en una coctelera no se vuelven un trago solos.", "src": "Two spirits in one tin do not become a drink on their own."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.1", "text": "Agítalo o revuélvelo. El recetario dice cuál.", "src": "Shake it or stir it. The book says which."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.0", "text": "La puerta ya está cerrada. Sírveme uno de lo que sí tengamos.", "src": "Door is shut. Pour me one of whatever we actually have."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.1", "text": "Primera noche del dueño. En algún lado es regla.", "src": "Owner's first night. It is a rule somewhere."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.declined.0", "text": "Le estás diciendo que no a tu bartender. Qué valiente.", "src": "You are turning down the bartender. Bold."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.nudge.0", "text": "Lo que sea de ese estante. La difícil no soy yo.", "src": "Anything on that shelf. I am not the difficult one."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.0", "text": "Nada mal para un salón que la semana pasada no existía.", "src": "Not bad for a room that did not exist last week."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.1", "text": "Los que vengan después de mí te van a contar los segundos. Yo no.", "src": "The ones who come after me will count your seconds. I do not."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_wrong.0", "text": "Eso no es lo que pedí, y eso que yo soy la fácil.", "src": "That is not what I asked for, and I am the easy one."},
{"key": "hud.closed.banner", "text": "EL BAR CERRÓ\ntres días perdiendo dinero — REINICIAR para intentarlo otra vez", "src": "THE BAR IS CLOSED\nthree days losing money — NEW RUN to try again"},
